+            // The bubble's units are chatContainer's (TalkPanel's) local units. ME's canvas shrinks with the window
+            // (CanvasScaler "Expand", 1536x1024 reference) and TalkPanel is scaled 0.8 on top, so both options start
+            // from how many screen pixels one unit is.
